# General Ferrous Rokiric: "Whenever you cast a multicolored spell, create a 4/4 red and white Golem artifact creature
# token." Bot1's Lightning Helix (red and white) makes one; its Lightning Bolt (red alone) makes none. Its "hexproof
# from monocolored" (CR 702.11d) is nothing against a colorless source, which is not monocolored (CR 105.2c; Sphinx
# of the Guildpact's ruling): Bot2's Lightning Bolt (red alone) can't target the General, but Bot2's Walking Ballista
# removes a counter to deal 1 damage to it, and it dies.

